    "description": "Iran’s sporting landscape includes international competition, community exercise, and traditions in which physical skill accompanies music, storytelling, and ethical instruction. Understanding it requires distinguishing athletic achievement, spectatorship, everyday participation, and the businesses surrounding sport and entertainment.",
    "tags": ["Iranian sport", "Sporting heritage", "Community exercise", "Women’s sport", "Digital entertainment"],
    "status": null,
    "editorial_status": "needs_research",
    "as_of_date": "2026-10-26",
